              {
                "_key": "s-1",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Through this structure, SAIS - UAQ’s Student Government embodies our commitment to a student-led school, fostering leadership, engagement, and a shared sense of ownership across the campus."
              }
            ],
            "markDefs": [],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "b-2",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
